1
00:00:39,859 --> 00:00:45,792
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:48,704
=Episode 15=

3
00:00:49,439 --> 00:00:50,000
Here.

4
00:00:50,719 --> 00:00:52,240
The good-looking gentleman

5
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,799
who came with you earlier

6
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:54,920
already paid.

7
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:55,920
Who

8
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:57,119
do you mean?

9
00:00:57,119 --> 00:00:58,240
The one

10
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,759
who didn't know how to pay.

11
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:03,520
He's shockingly generous.

12
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,879
He just tossed me a huge pearl.

13
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:10,959
Others usually

14
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,959
carve a pair of names,

15
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,359
but he only carved one.

16
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,640
I asked for his name

17
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:16,840
to carve his,

18
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,000
but he ignored me.

19
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:19,760
Do you know where he went?

20
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,760
He hung the wooden tablet on the tree,

21
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:23,840
and then

22
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,480
I lost track of him.

23
00:01:29,555 --> 00:01:31,712
(Wangshu)

24
00:01:34,432 --> 00:01:37,376
(Wangshu)

25
00:01:38,144 --> 00:01:41,856
♪Hidden thoughts grow fierce
in the silence♪

26
00:01:42,016 --> 00:01:44,864
♪If all past entanglements
could be forgotten♪

27
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,519
Lizhi.

28
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:48,840
Lizhi!

29
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,000
Lizhi!

30
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:53,920
Lizhi!

31
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:57,040
Lizhi!

32
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,840
I know.

33
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,200
I know you helped me at the yamen.

34
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,439
And I know

35
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:04,400
you must be protecting me.

36
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:11,759
(That isn't love.)

37
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,960
That's the primal fear
of having no control over life and death

38
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:18,000
when a mortal faces supreme power.

39
00:02:19,319 --> 00:02:20,479
Besides,

40
00:02:20,479 --> 00:02:21,439
you will leave soon.

41
00:02:23,919 --> 00:02:24,800
I know.

42
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:26,400
I know you're here.

43
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,080
You just carved my name

44
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,680
on a wooden tablet right on this street.

45
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,560
You're right here.

46
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,599
You care about me, don't you?

47
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:36,240
Why won't you show yourself?

48
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:37,800
Why?

49
00:02:39,072 --> 00:02:42,784
♪A riddle without an answer
in this life♪

50
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:43,960
Lizhi.

51
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,240
Lizhi!

52
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,919
Please show up.

53
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,199
Lizhi.

54
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,479
Lizhi!

55
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:56,672
♪That cruel deceit♪

56
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,800
I'm sorry.

57
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,039
I'm sorry.

58
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Where are you?

59
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:07,800
Why won't you show up?

60
00:03:11,796 --> 00:03:13,299
(Wangshu)

61
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,240
His Majesty is unwell,

62
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,120
unable to handle court affairs.

63
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:24,039
You worry for the nation,

64
00:03:24,039 --> 00:03:25,039
toiling day and night.

65
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,759
Yet those blind fools

66
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:28,120
actually cursed Your Highness.

67
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,360
They deserve to die!

68
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:32,560
Serving the country is a thankless task.

69
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:34,719
Wait.

70
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:37,800
How did he find out
about the forged decree

71
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,120
and the ritual sacrifice?

72
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,599
Your Highness!

73
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:42,800
Your Highness!

74
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,560
Urgent news!

75
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,599
The Yue family is being investigated!

76
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,120
The Yue family?

77
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,919
What is that useless Zhang Fan

78
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,400
trying to do?

79
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,840
The imperial censor
is supervising it in person.

80
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,639
The imperial censor?

81
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:02,439
The one the Emperor sent to Daizhou?

82
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,960
When did this happen?

83
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,599
Why report it only now?

84
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:07,319
All the dispatches we sent

85
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,439
were intercepted halfway.

86
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:10,199
Intercepted?

87
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,000
Yes.

88
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:16,079
This imperial censor

89
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,279
slipped past my elite guards

90
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:21,079
and intercepted my couriers.

91
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,040
On my own turf,

92
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,000
he dares shake my foundation.

93
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,839
He is something.

94
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,519
Why did I

95
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,240
know nothing about him before?

96
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:35,800
The Emperor skips court in sick,

97
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,720
while the imperial censor
drops into Daizhou

98
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,920
and pulls off so many major moves.

99
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,519
Impressive.

100
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:49,199
What a sharp imperial censor.

101
00:04:51,279 --> 00:04:52,879
It seems the man in Daizhou

102
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:55,319
is not the imperial censor at all.

103
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:02,120
It seems I really

104
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,000
underestimated you.

105
00:05:06,199 --> 00:05:07,000
Fine.

106
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:09,360
Since you want to play games with me,

107
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,360
I'll gladly

108
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:14,040
play this round with you.

109
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:19,319
Your Majesty,

110
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,319
you personally handled the Yues' case.

111
00:05:22,839 --> 00:05:23,920
Prince Qi must have

112
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,800
already discovered your whereabouts.

113
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,000
This is

114
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,000
basically picking a fight with him.

115
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,360
Yet your forces are limited right now.

116
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:33,839
A head-on clash is unwise.

117
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,920
I know what you're worried about.

118
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,480
I'm not fighting

119
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,279
on a whim.

120
00:05:39,759 --> 00:05:40,920
The day I met Master Lizhi

121
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,920
at Chunfeng Pavilion,

122
00:05:43,439 --> 00:05:44,399
I knew

123
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:47,720
he was the heaven-sent way out for me.

124
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:50,000
You saw what happened afterward.

125
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:54,199
He is my true trump card.

126
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,720
However,

127
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,399
I haven't seen him again

128
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,160
ever since that day.

129
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:00,279
Your Majesty.

130
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,240
Your Majesty.

131
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,360
Lady Xingyao is here.

132
00:06:03,759 --> 00:06:04,319
Show her in.

133
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:04,896
Yes, Sire.

134
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,800
Take two hours off.

135
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:11,639
Go take a walk

136
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,519
and unwind.

137
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:15,920
Go on.

138
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
Lady Xingyao.

139
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,199
Thank you for helping us at the yamen.

140
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,839
I came today to bring you these.

141
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:39,519
I've cataloged all the key details

142
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,519
and filed the original documents.

143
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,959
Before, I only saw you

144
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:05,839
getting angry and splashing water on me.

145
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:08,759
I never expected you
to be so meticulous.

146
00:07:09,319 --> 00:07:11,160
You're far better
than the court officials.

147
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,319
I'm flattered, My Lord.

148
00:07:14,199 --> 00:07:15,079
My Lord?

149
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:23,160
Master Wei Xun.

150
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:30,360
Yue Xingyao!

151
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,319
Zhang Jin?

152
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:41,079
No wonder you are
acting so bold suddenly.

153
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:44,279
You've been fooling around
with this man.

154
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:47,160
Too bad I brought plenty of men today.

155
00:07:47,519 --> 00:07:49,759
Chen Qingxuan, see them out.

156
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,360
I just sent my guards out for tea.

157
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,560
Lady Xingyao, in a moment, you...

158
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,279
Zhang Jin,

159
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:08,480
your father is the prefect.

160
00:08:09,399 --> 00:08:10,600
Didn't he tell you

161
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,319
who's standing in front of you?

162
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:13,399
Him?

163
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,160
He's just an imperial censor.

164
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,439
What's the big deal?

165
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:20,240
Who calls the shots in this country now?

166
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:21,959
Prince Qi does!

167
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:24,199
Daizhou is Prince Qi's territory.

168
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,399
Yue Xingyao,

169
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,079
did you think
clinging to this imperial censor

170
00:08:28,079 --> 00:08:29,160
would solve everything?

171
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:30,399
Don't be silly!

172
00:08:30,959 --> 00:08:33,559
Today, right before Lady Xingyao,

173
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:36,039
I'll break this imperial censor's legs!

174
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,759
Get him!

175
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,399
Hold on.

176
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,960
Are your daily wages

177
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,639
paid by Zhang Fan

178
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:43,799
or by Zhang Jin?

179
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,720
Does Zhang Fan even know

180
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,559
about this raid?

181
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,960
You're attacking a censor.

182
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,919
When the court assigns blame,

183
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:52,600
do you think
Zhang Fan will turn in his son,

184
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,480
or make you take the blame?

185
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:58,159
Don't look at me.

186
00:08:58,159 --> 00:08:59,320
Get him!

187
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:00,519
Move!

188
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,559
Kneel!

189
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:03,519
Kneel!

190
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:04,159
Father?

191
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:04,720
Kneel!

192
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,080
Zhang Fan,

193
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:12,000
your son is extraordinarily bold.

194
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,240
I failed to discipline him.

195
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,279
Father, he's just an imperial censor!

196
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:17,960
Don't lecture him here.

197
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,159
Out of my sight!

198
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:19,759
Thank you.

199
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:20,440
My Lord.

200
00:09:21,159 --> 00:09:22,320
Get out of here.

201
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,039
Hurry up!

202
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:31,759
Father, he's just an imperial censor!

203
00:09:31,759 --> 00:09:32,919
What are you afraid of?

204
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:35,799
Imperial censor?

205
00:09:35,919 --> 00:09:37,080
He is the Emperor himself!

206
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,480
The Emperor?

207
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:42,000
Thanks to you today, Lady Xingyao.

208
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,720
If your words hadn't held them off,

209
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,559
my legs

210
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:47,639
would've been broken.

211
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:50,960
Then doesn't that mean
you owe me a favor?

212
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,279
Of course.

213
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,399
That's why

214
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:55,000
I walked you back to repay you

215
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:55,919
with my company.

216
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:58,440
The way I see it,

217
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,600
I was the one escorting you.

218
00:10:01,159 --> 00:10:01,960
In a moment,

219
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:04,039
will I have to walk you back too?

220
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:29,559
I'm here.

221
00:10:36,947 --> 00:10:37,639
Well,

222
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:38,480
go back and rest.

223
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,519
All right.

224
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:44,480
Lady Xingyao,

225
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,679
no one will ever trouble you again.

226
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,279
Your Majesty.

227
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:07,360
Your Majesty.

228
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:11,799
Been tailing me?

229
00:11:12,519 --> 00:11:13,480
Your Majesty.

230
00:11:16,159 --> 00:11:16,679
Any clues?

231
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:17,568
Yes.

232
00:11:17,799 --> 00:11:18,799
The General's Manor

233
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,360
put Zhang Jin up to show up.

234
00:11:23,159 --> 00:11:26,559
Send our best guards to protect her

235
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,519
and her sister in secret,

236
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:30,399
without the slightest mishap.

237
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:31,440
Yes.

238
00:11:44,159 --> 00:11:46,399
Madam, forgive us.
There's nothing we can do.

239
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:47,960
Useless fools!

240
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,919
You quacks!

241
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:49,919
Get out, all of you!

242
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,360
Mother, Zhu Heng hushed everything up.

243
00:11:55,639 --> 00:11:57,120
Those soldiers won't say a word.

244
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:58,840
Are we just going to drop this?

245
00:11:59,159 --> 00:12:00,679
Your brother's wound...

246
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:01,639
The physician said

247
00:12:02,799 --> 00:12:04,559
it was caused by sorcery.

248
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,639
Medicine can't heal it.

249
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:10,159
Just like in court that day...

250
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:16,639
What kind of creature
has she attached herself to?

251
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,919
Madam, My Lady,

252
00:12:19,799 --> 00:12:20,840
the officers came again.

253
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:23,519
They're summoning you both
for questioning.

254
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:25,559
Just because an imperial censor
backs him,

255
00:12:25,559 --> 00:12:27,519
Zhang Fan thinks
he can walk all over us?

256
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:28,320
We won't go!

257
00:12:28,519 --> 00:12:29,080
Wait.

258
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:35,039
You carry my words back to Lord Zhang.

259
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,200
Once my son gets better,

260
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,799
I will go to the prefecture myself

261
00:12:39,279 --> 00:12:42,240
and clear everything up.

262
00:12:42,388 --> 00:12:44,864
(Yamen)

263
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:50,639
Mother,

264
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,240
we just

265
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,639
let Zhang Fan keep digging?

266
00:12:53,799 --> 00:12:56,279
Zhang Fan is useless now.

267
00:12:57,039 --> 00:12:58,399
Hire some cutthroats.

268
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:00,919
I want Yue Wangshu and Yue Xingyao

269
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:03,039
silenced forever.

270
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,200
Yes, Mother.

271
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,679
Lady Wangshu, Lady Xingyao,

272
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:17,840
this is the place.

273
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:20,559
When the General and Madam were alive,

274
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:21,720
our pharmacy

275
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,840
saved countless lives in Daizhou.

276
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,919
Madam always taught us

277
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:28,039
that a pharmacy is meant to save lives,

278
00:13:28,279 --> 00:13:29,600
not to make a fortune.

279
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:30,840
Yet they

280
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,320
treated this pharmacy

281
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,480
as nothing but a money trap.

282
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:35,799
You two

283
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,720
have finally returned.

284
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,960
Thank heavens!

285
00:13:40,399 --> 00:13:41,720
Thank heavens!

286
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,679
Uncle Fu, that's in the past.

287
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:49,080
Please find a place to settle down.

288
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:51,000
The pharmacy needs reopening,

289
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,320
so we'll be counting on you.

290
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:54,240
Well, I can't take this.

291
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,000
Uncle Fu,

292
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,960
this is a small token from both of us.

293
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,840
Please accept it.

294
00:13:59,519 --> 00:14:01,600
From now on,

295
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,200
you run this shop.

296
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:05,360
All right, I'll head back then.

297
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:06,960
Take care.

298
00:14:14,639 --> 00:14:15,440
Xingyao.

299
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:31,840
Wangshu.

300
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,159
What's on your mind?

301
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,279
I was thinking

302
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:36,799
we must live well

303
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,320
and help more people.

304
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:42,559
Xingyao,

305
00:14:43,159 --> 00:14:44,039
I am

306
00:14:44,399 --> 00:14:45,720
not good at accounting.

307
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:46,519
From now on,

308
00:14:47,399 --> 00:14:48,200
you run the books.

309
00:14:48,519 --> 00:14:49,639
Just leave the manual work

310
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,240
to me.

311
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:52,840
All right.

312
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,840
Master Wei Xun, what brings you here?

313
00:15:20,759 --> 00:15:21,679
I came to deliver this.

314
00:15:22,679 --> 00:15:23,679
Lizhi has already...

315
00:15:23,679 --> 00:15:25,320
I'm not here for Master Lizhi.

316
00:15:25,759 --> 00:15:27,200
I came to see Lady Xingyao.

317
00:15:27,639 --> 00:15:29,879
Your aunt betrothed you
to the Zhang family.

318
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,039
It's time

319
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:32,840
(Annulment Letter)
to put an end to it.

320
00:15:36,052 --> 00:15:38,048
(Annulment Letter)

321
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,000
Thank you, Master Wei.

322
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,039
It was no trouble.

323
00:16:00,879 --> 00:16:01,799
Master Wei Xun,

324
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:06,320
if saving your life was a favor,

325
00:16:06,639 --> 00:16:08,720
you repaid it
by helping us at the yamen.

326
00:16:08,919 --> 00:16:10,840
Yet you often come,

327
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,559
bring medicine,

328
00:16:12,759 --> 00:16:13,919
and things like that.

329
00:16:15,279 --> 00:16:16,600
Is it all for Master Lizhi?

330
00:16:19,159 --> 00:16:21,279
Master Lizhi is an extraordinary figure.

331
00:16:21,519 --> 00:16:22,200
I truly

332
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,639
admire him deeply.

333
00:16:24,759 --> 00:16:25,960
Yet he's already gone.

334
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:29,200
So, Master Wei,

335
00:16:29,639 --> 00:16:31,399
if Master Lizhi

336
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,360
truly vanished forever,

337
00:16:33,559 --> 00:16:34,720
would you still

338
00:16:35,159 --> 00:16:37,080
often bring stuff to us?

339
00:16:41,011 --> 00:16:45,586
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

340
00:16:46,361 --> 00:16:50,858
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

341
00:16:54,097 --> 00:16:59,219
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

342
00:16:59,219 --> 00:17:02,558
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

343
00:17:02,558 --> 00:17:03,922
♪Refusing to forget♪

344
00:17:07,588 --> 00:17:12,365
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

345
00:17:12,916 --> 00:17:14,706
♪He cannot learn them♪

346
00:17:14,706 --> 00:17:17,841
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

347
00:17:20,993 --> 00:17:23,317
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

348
00:17:23,317 --> 00:17:25,680
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

349
00:17:26,258 --> 00:17:28,922
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

350
00:17:28,922 --> 00:17:30,680
♪Their days ahead are long♪
